CLI and API expose only the first ten locations of repeated warnings.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight accounts --format json

========== API ==========

accounts()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
P 2024-01-01 FUND 1 SEK
P 2024-01-02 FUND 1 SEK
P 2024-01-03 FUND 1 SEK
P 2024-01-04 FUND 1 SEK
